Provenance (B-046): every MCP tool call and every client RPC that changes something is recorded in the
action log. McpHttpServer wraps each tool in `traced`; RpcInstrumentation exposes `instrumentRpc` so the
per-socket `rpcActionLayer` can add the record around the same metrics and span.

